# Kill Switch — RSVP Control Panel
# Generate a strong secret: openssl rand -base64 24
# Add BOTH of these to Vercel Dashboard > hive-buckhead > Settings > Environment Variables
# Set for: Production, Preview, Development
KILL_SWITCH_SECRET=your-secret-here
NEXT_PUBLIC_KILL_SWITCH_SECRET=your-secret-here
# (They must be the same value)

# The /control page sends this secret in x-kill-switch-secret header
# The /api/kill-switch route validates it
# This allows the kill switch to work without requiring a staff login session
